B.ah5=new A.ju("How do I pay?","In person, directly to the business, when the job is done or the order is handed over \u2014 cash or card, whatever the business accepts. LocalHive never collects card details in the app.")
B.ah3=new A.ju("What is the platform fee?","A flat 12% platform fee, always itemised at checkout before you confirm. The total you see at checkout is the total you pay \u2014 no surprises on handover.")
B.SN=s([B.ah5,B.ah3],t.Bt)
B.agV=new A.wD("Payments & fees",B.SN,null)
B.ah4=new A.ju("How do I list my business?","Profile \u2192 Become a provider. Complete the three-step application \u2014 service details, availability, and verification consents. Once approved, your listing goes live and new orders appear on your Dashboard tab with the customer's details and what to prepare.")
B.ah7=new A.ju("How do deliveries work?","Switch to delivery mode in Profile. Open jobs appear on the Deliveries tab, newest first. Claim a job, pick up the order, and confirm handover by entering the customer's 4-digit OTP. The customer can watch your position while you're on the way.")
B.Wv=s([B.ah4,B.ah7],t.Bt)
B.agW=new A.wD("For businesses & delivery partners",B.Wv,null)
B.ah2=new A.ju("How do I talk to Olivia?",'Tap Ask Olivia, allow microphone access when your browser asks, then hold the mic button and speak \u2014 "find me tacos nearby" or "book a cleaner for tomorrow morning". Olivia drafts the order and shows you a confirmation card; nothing is placed until you confirm it.')
B.ah_=new A.ju("Olivia can't hear me.","Check that your browser has microphone permission for this site (look for the mic icon in the address bar). On iPhone use Safari; on Android use Chrome. If you denied permission earlier, re-enable it in site settings and reload.")
B.Uo=s([B.ah2,B.ah_],t.Bt)
B.agX=new A.wD("Olivia voice assistant",B.Uo,null)
B.ah0=new A.ju("Where is my order?","Open the Bookings tab. Everything in progress is at the top, newest first, with its live status \u2014 Placed, Preparing, Ready, or Out for delivery. Delivery orders show a Track button once a delivery partner is on the way.")
B.ah6=new A.ju("How do I cancel a booking?","You can cancel a service request free of charge any time before the business accepts it: open Bookings and tap Cancel request on the booking. After a business has accepted, contact them directly \u2014 their phone number is on your booking confirmation messages.")
B.agZ=new A.ju("What is the delivery OTP?","Delivery orders include a 4-digit code shown in your Bookings tab. Share it only with the delivery partner when they hand over your order \u2014 it confirms the delivery reached you.")
B.ah1=new A.ju("The business declined my request. Was I charged?","No. You never pay in advance on LocalHive, so a declined or cancelled booking costs nothing. Pick another nearby provider and rebook.")
B.UA=s([B.ah0,B.ah6,B.agZ,B.ah1],t.Bt)
B.agY=new A.wD("Orders & bookings",B.UA,null)
